    "description": "US pushes for deeper two-way trade and investment flows with Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/US-pushes-for-deeper-two-way-trade-and-investment-flows-with-Sri-Lanka/34-790579",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
