    "chunk_text": "The Archbishop\u2019s sermon has added significance in the context of the shocking silence of other religious, civil society, and business leaders in the country, including Pathfinders, Am-Chambers, Center for Policy Alternatives etc., even while every human being in the planet is disproportionately made to pay for an unprovoked and illegal war unleashed by the Israelis and the Americans directly on Iran but virtually on every living thing in the world.\n\nAccording to PBS News, Hegseth, US Defence Secretary since January 2025, re-designated in September 2025 as \u201cSecretary of War\u201dcommenced a monthly Christian Prayer series at the Pentagon last year with Hegseth, urging all Americans to pray in schools, churches and public centres for victory at war. The first prayer service after the war with Iran was on 25 March. PBS News reported that prayers invoked Biblical imagery from Psalms calling for \u201cviolent action against enemies\u201d.\n\nPBS also reported that Hegseth\u2019s insertion of his Christian faith and rhetoric has come under scrutiny including his interest in the historical crusades.Meanwhile the \u2018Americans United for Separation of Church and the State\u2019 had filed a lawsuit to enforce a public records request for the monthly Christian prayer service.\n\nIt is quite obvious that given the ever widening protests in both the US and Israel against the war, Hegseth is trying to exploit religion to sustain the illegal war on Iran."
